instead, you hide your hands and arms and turn on your hips.

1674
01:11:26.410 --> 01:11:27.660
And it takes six minutes.

1675
01:11:28.770 --> 01:11:30.260
So it's called an intervention.

1676
01:11:30.260 --> 01:11:33.270
When I get the stimulus, okay, he's down now,

1677
01:11:33.270 --> 01:11:35.040
I don't have somebody on top of me, right?

1678
01:11:35.040 --> 01:11:37.793
I have let's say the disobedience of a child.

1679
01:11:38.950 --> 01:11:41.410
I've trained myself that my response is gonna be,

1680
01:11:41.410 --> 01:11:43.050
wall of virtue.

1681
01:11:43.050 --> 01:11:45.310
Which is like hiding my hands and turning on my hips.

1682
01:11:45.310 --> 01:11:46.143
Yeah.

1683
01:11:46.143 --> 01:11:46.976
It takes training.

1684
01:11:46.976 --> 01:11:47.809
So how do you train?

1685
01:11:47.809 --> 01:11:50.189
I say, you wake up in the morning and you train.

1686
01:11:50.189 --> 01:11:51.022
Yeah, you do the thing.

1687
01:11:51.022 --> 01:11:53.850
You train let's say, wall of virtue.

1688
01:11:53.850 --> 01:11:57.700
No anger, no Four Cs, no bad JEDDI, train, train, train,

1689
01:11:57.700 --> 01:11:59.280
and one day, your kid's gonna say something

1690
01:11:59.280 --> 01:12:01.060
you're gonna go, wall of virtue.

1691
01:12:01.060 --> 01:12:02.230
Mm.

1692
01:12:02.230 --> 01:12:07.020
But, good. JEDDI training is the path, right?

1693
