I often think what would a JEDDI do in this situation?

1694
01:12:09.910 --> 01:12:11.371
JEDDI never reacts.

1695
01:12:11.371 --> 01:12:12.204
Yeah.

1696
01:12:12.204 --> 01:12:13.340
Never loses their shit.

1697
01:12:13.340 --> 01:12:15.160
Yeah and JEDDIs can have fun, they can joke

1698
