There's an adult in the room.

1702
01:12:25.220 --> 01:12:26.053
Okay?

1703
01:12:26.053 --> 01:12:27.990
I'm gonna hold down the moral center.

1704
01:12:27.990 --> 01:12:29.070
So the kid does something you'd say,

1705
01:12:29.070 --> 01:12:30.490
oh, so you've changed the game?

1706
01:12:30.490 --> 01:12:32.560
You're doing the disobedience game?

1707
01:12:32.560 --> 01:12:34.620
Okay, I have a response to that.

1708
01:12:34.620 --> 01:12:35.453
Yeah.

1709
01:12:35.453 --> 01:12:38.283
But I'm not going to give myself a moral arm lock.

1710
01:12:39.700 --> 01:12:40.533
Right.

1711
01:12:40.533 --> 01:12:42.910
'Cause pushing is like arm lock me.

1712
01:12:42.910 --> 01:12:44.250
Right.
That's a white belt thing.

1713
01:12:44.250 --> 01:12:45.083
Right.

1714
01:12:45.083 --> 01:12:46.450
So you want to go up in the belts?

1715
01:12:46.450 --> 01:12:48.070
When someone does something to anger you,

1716
01:12:48.070 --> 01:12:49.330
wall of virtue kicks in.

1717
