you're allowing your child to do what they're doing,

1721
01:13:01.120 --> 01:13:06.120
you're not pushing your arm out to use the jujitsu analogy,

1722
01:13:06.670 --> 01:13:08.290
you're kind of, you know,

1723
01:13:08.290 --> 01:13:10.593
adjusting in a counterintuitive way,

1724
01:13:11.760 --> 01:13:15.560
but the pushing back is what then amplifies.

1725
01:13:15.560 --> 01:13:16.393
Exactly.

1726
01:13:16.393 --> 01:13:19.103
So ideally, if my child does something,

1727
01:13:20.620 --> 01:13:22.610
like my kids and my youngest is now 24,

1728
