1736
01:13:34.847 --> 01:13:36.930
She'll say, "dad, it's not working for me."

1737
01:13:36.930 --> 01:13:37.950
And we disengage.

1738
01:13:37.950 --> 01:13:38.783
Right.

1739
01:13:38.783 --> 01:13:39.920
And then we'll talk about it later.

1740
01:13:39.920 --> 01:13:40.770
Right.

1741
01:13:40.770 --> 01:13:42.500
So the thing is, you train yourself.

1742
01:13:42.500 --> 01:13:47.500
When I feel anger, I go to the wall of virtue

