01:13:47.566 --> 01:13:49.970
and then I have a script waiting for me which is,

1744
01:13:49.970 --> 01:13:51.600
it's not working for me right now.

1745
01:13:51.600 --> 01:13:52.950
Can we talk later?

1746
01:13:52.950 --> 01:13:54.900
Now that's like training.

1747
01:13:54.900 --> 01:13:56.487
That's what a good blue belt can do.

1748
01:13:56.487 --> 01:13:57.350
All right.

