2505
01:41:44.080 --> 01:41:45.580
So it's-
Right, that's cool.

2506
01:41:45.580 --> 01:41:47.203
Yeah, I learned a lot.

2507
01:41:48.217 --> 01:41:51.610
I wouldn't be doing this if every time I taught

