2509
01:41:53.670 --> 01:41:54.833
Yeah.

2510
01:41:54.833 --> 01:41:56.090
I mean, it's transformative working with people

2511
01:41:56.090 --> 01:41:57.200
who are doing the work.

2512
01:41:57.200 --> 01:41:58.570
Yeah. Beautiful.

2513
01:41:58.570 --> 01:42:00.130
Yeah.

2514
01:42:00.130 --> 01:42:01.560
I want to shift gears a little bit here.

2515
01:42:01.560 --> 01:42:02.393
Sure.

