01:42:09.976 --> 01:42:10.809
Okay.

2523
01:42:10.809 --> 01:42:12.310
Other than that at some point

2524
01:42:12.310 --> 01:42:15.190
there was a cultural inflection point

2525
01:42:15.190 --> 01:42:18.120
that involved Madonna and a lot of people wearing

2526
01:42:18.120 --> 01:42:19.697
red strings on their wrists?

2527
01:42:19.697 --> 01:42:20.530
Yeah.

2528
01:42:20.530 --> 01:42:24.980
And I know it's a journey into mysticism on some level

2529
01:42:27.780 --> 01:42:30.680
