01:53:29.930 --> 01:53:32.520
If we're studying justice and rationality and judgment,

2822
01:53:32.520 --> 01:53:33.560
why have a different set of questions.

2823
01:53:33.560 --> 01:53:35.460
So this is the beautiful thing about it,

2824
01:53:35.460 --> 01:53:37.150
is when we're studying the spiritual psychology

2825
01:53:37.150 --> 01:53:39.760
of the Kabbalah, we're studying this one today.

2826
01:53:39.760 --> 01:53:42.200
Now they all interconnect obviously.

2827
01:53:42.200 --> 01:53:43.870
But you see the two things you just brought up,

2828
01:53:43.870 --> 01:53:47.560
