2839
01:54:04.890 --> 01:54:06.840
I'm not judgemental though, that's all.

2840
01:54:06.840 --> 01:54:09.163
Your strain of this is called Lurianic, right?

2841
01:54:09.163 --> 01:54:09.996
Yeah.

2842
01:54:09.996 --> 01:54:10.870
