2843
01:54:10.870 --> 01:54:11.957
Okay.

2844
01:54:11.957 --> 01:54:14.659
So Isaac Luria, so the Kabbalah develops

2845
01:54:14.659 --> 01:54:16.003
in the late 1100s, 1200s,

2846
01:54:18.750 --> 01:54:23.120
and Isaac Luria added a dimension that these emanations

2847
01:54:23.120 --> 01:54:26.350
that we're talking about, cracked and broke.

2848
01:54:26.350 --> 01:54:29.423
So he added the idea of the breaking of the vessels.

2849
01:54:30.410 --> 01:54:31.770
Okay?
Right.

2850
01:54:31.770 --> 01:54:35.440
So, it's as it were the mind of God

2851
01:54:36.410 --> 01:54:38.023
that we can apprehend shattered.

2852
01:54:39.800 --> 01:54:42.674
So, we therefore are each,

2853
01:54:42.674 --> 01:54:45.043
articulations of the shattered mind of God.

2854
01:54:46.170 --> 01:54:47.720
I know it's a strange theology.

2855
01:54:49.750 --> 01:54:52.073
So, how do we heal God?

2856
01:54:52.940 --> 01:54:55.010
By healing the shattered vessels within us.

2857
01:54:55.010 --> 01:54:55.970
Mm-hmm.

2858
01:54:55.970 --> 01:54:57.280
I like that.

2859
01:54:57.280 --> 01:54:58.500
Isn't it great?
It's beautiful.

2860
01:54:58.500 --> 01:55:00.370
I don't pray for God to heal me,

2861
01:55:00.370 --> 01:55:02.600
God wants me to heal God.

2862
01:55:02.600 --> 01:55:03.433
Mm-hmm.

2863
01:55:03.433 --> 01:55:04.710
How do I heal myself?

2864
01:55:04.710 --> 01:55:05.770
Repair my vessels.

2865
01:55:05.770 --> 01:55:07.950
That's how I heal God, that's how I heal you.

2866
01:55:07.950 --> 01:55:09.660
If you and I have a relationship

2867
01:55:09.660 --> 01:55:12.100
and we both know we come with shattered vessels,

2868
01:55:12.100 --> 01:55:13.520
let's help each other.

2869
01:55:13.520 --> 01:55:15.630
And in doing so, we heal God.

2870
01:55:15.630 --> 01:55:18.610
So as ultimately humanistic, because the focus is not on,

2871
01:55:18.610 --> 01:55:20.700
oh God, please, but rather,

2872
01:55:20.700 --> 01:55:24.160
God, you gave me a duty to repair the vessels,

2873
01:55:24.160 --> 01:55:25.800
I'll spend my life trying to repair my vessels

2874
01:55:25.800 --> 01:55:27.760
and help other people and the end of my life

2875
01:55:27.760 --> 01:55:28.830
I'll show you my work.

2876
01:55:28.830 --> 01:55:32.510
Well, there's a Zen Buddhism flare to that in that,

2877
01:55:32.510 --> 01:55:36.890
the path forward is really an internal journey

2878
01:55:36.890 --> 01:55:40.890
of becoming the most fully authentic version of yourself.

2879
01:55:40.890 --> 01:55:41.820
You nailed it.

2880
01:55:41.820 --> 01:55:44.773
So this is a path toward authenticity in our work,

2881
01:55:46.060 --> 01:55:48.990
moral growth guided by the system

2882
01:55:48.990 --> 01:55:51.650
of the spiritual psychologic kabbalah.

2883
01:55:51.650 --> 01:55:52.557
And when people say,

2884
01:55:52.557 --> 01:55:54.190
