I say, no, you found out the nature

2886
01:55:56.100 --> 01:55:58.090
of your shattered vessels.

2887
01:55:58.090 --> 01:55:59.730
And that's why on the character defect.

2888
01:55:59.730 --> 01:56:02.800
And what a beautiful epiphany

2889
01:56:02.800 --> 01:56:04.177
