2890
01:56:04.177 --> 01:56:06.262
Yes, when I say to people, I say,

2891
01:56:06.262 --> 01:56:07.660
there's nothing wrong with you discovered your work.

2892
01:56:07.660 --> 01:56:09.600
I mean, that really relieves people.

