What I like is, I've discovered the work I need to do.

2899
01:56:26.440 --> 01:56:27.273
Mm-hmm.

2900
01:56:27.273 --> 01:56:29.420
Which means you discovered your configuration

2901
01:56:29.420 --> 01:56:30.853
of the brokenness of God,

2902
01:56:32.001 --> 01:56:34.066
