2903
01:56:34.066 --> 01:56:34.899
It's nothing wrong with you.

2904
01:56:34.899 --> 01:56:38.880
You discovered your participation in the brokenness of God,

2905
01:56:38.880 --> 01:56:40.290
get to work.
Mm-hmm.

2906
01:56:40.290 --> 01:56:43.050
So for me, it takes away the shame of,

2907
01:56:43.050 --> 01:56:45.390
oh my God, this is wrong with me, I'm bad at this,

2908
01:56:45.390 --> 01:56:49.437
and, you know, I'm not an iron man.

2909
