And I say, it's okay, you just discovered your work.

2910
01:56:51.260 --> 01:56:52.093
That's okay.

2911
01:56:52.093 --> 01:56:52.926
Wow.

2912
01:56:52.926 --> 01:56:53.759
You just discovered your work.

2913
01:56:53.759 --> 01:56:54.770
Yeah. That's really cool

2914
01:56:54.770 --> 01:56:58.780
