2915
01:56:58.780 --> 01:56:59.810
Absolutely.
Yeah.

2916
01:56:59.810 --> 01:57:01.260
All you've done is discover your work,

2917
01:57:01.260 --> 01:57:02.367
there's nothing wrong with you.

2918
01:57:02.367 --> 01:57:03.200
Mm-hmm.

2919
01:57:03.200 --> 01:57:04.634
So for me to say, "guys, I'm such a fuck up."

2920
01:57:04.634 --> 01:57:05.467
I said, no, you're not.

2921
