2938
01:57:38.020 --> 01:57:39.073
Only you can do it.

2939
01:57:41.710 --> 01:57:43.409
Hmm.
Yeah, so, it's a-

2940
01:57:43.409 --> 01:57:46.610
There's a...In just pondering that,

2941
01:57:46.610 --> 01:57:50.990
there's like this infusion of agency, right?

2942
01:57:50.990 --> 01:57:52.583
You got it, man, you got it.

2943
01:57:53.440 --> 01:57:56.890
Now this is Finley's interpretation of Lurianic Kabbalah.

2944
01:57:56.890 --> 01:58:00.710
But for me, Lurianic Kabbalah produces a powerful degree,

2945
01:58:00.710 --> 01:58:02.723
exactly as you said of human agency.

2946
