The person who produced Anthony is his woman,

2981
01:59:33.220 --> 01:59:36.210
wife, woman, blue alert,

2982
01:59:36.210 --> 01:59:37.660
it's a guy named Larry Klein.

2983
01:59:38.630 --> 01:59:41.160
Larry's a member of the congregation and Larry and Lucy

2984
