2991
01:59:52.940 --> 01:59:54.550
They say, "okay, you."

2992
01:59:54.550 --> 01:59:55.383
All right?

2993
01:59:55.383 --> 01:59:57.660
So I was centered, seated next to Leonard,

2994
01:59:57.660 --> 01:59:59.440
I didn't know who he was, I heard the name, Leonard Cohen,

2995
01:59:59.440 --> 02:00:00.990
