02:00:08.690 --> 02:00:11.180
So remember that, be happy, don't worry?

3001
02:00:11.180 --> 02:00:12.013
Yeah.

3002
02:00:12.013 --> 02:00:13.430
So I said, worry, 'cause it was actually

3003
02:00:13.430 --> 02:00:14.960
a Jewish spiritual practice, which is,

3004
02:00:14.960 --> 02:00:17.760
worry about if you're a virtuous person.

3005
02:00:17.760 --> 02:00:20.920
Not worry about outcomes, worry about yourself.

3006
02:00:20.920 --> 02:00:24.510
And then instead of being angry, be sad.

3007
02:00:24.510 --> 02:00:27.960
So I said, forget about, don't worry, be happy,

3008
02:00:27.960 --> 02:00:31.810
and then I explained, be sad and worry,

3009
02:00:31.810 --> 02:00:34.680
but I translated into Jewish, spiritual psychology.

3010
02:00:34.680 --> 02:00:35.513
Okay.

3011
02:00:35.513 --> 02:00:36.346
You want to be a good person?

3012
02:00:36.346 --> 02:00:37.180
Worry about yourself.

3013
02:00:38.520 --> 02:00:41.340
Don't get angry, be sad that you're not getting your way.

3014
02:00:41.340 --> 02:00:43.570
So I went through these 10 contrarian commandments

3015
02:00:43.570 --> 02:00:45.055
