3021
02:00:55.026 --> 02:00:55.859
You know?

3022
02:00:55.859 --> 02:00:57.650
So he and Anthony really dug it.

3023
02:00:57.650 --> 02:00:58.483
Mm-hmm.

3024
02:01:00.880 --> 02:01:02.510
I go home and call my wife who was in Israel

3025
