3075
02:02:56.550 --> 02:02:57.950
It was an interesting thing.

3076
02:02:59.750 --> 02:03:03.580
I think he wanted a rabbi who meant it,

3077
02:03:03.580 --> 02:03:05.090
in the deepest way imaginable

3078
02:03:05.090 --> 02:03:07.370
and he thrived on it and I thrived on him.

3079
02:03:07.370 --> 02:03:10.140
So, people ask me about his music, I say,

3080
02:03:10.140 --> 02:03:12.950
look, I'm not an expert on Leonard Cohen music.

3081
02:03:12.950 --> 02:03:16.050
And we were friends to a point I was his rabbi,

3082
02:03:16.050 --> 02:03:17.526
I don't have anything more to say.

3083
02:03:17.526 --> 02:03:18.666
Right.

3084
02:03:18.666 --> 02:03:21.571
And he characterized himself as more of a Zen Buddhist,

3085
02:03:21.571 --> 02:03:22.404
right?

3086
02:03:22.404 --> 02:03:23.530
Well, he said this, he said, Zen Buddhism

3087
02:03:23.530 --> 02:03:24.500
is not a religion, he said,

3088
02:03:24.500 --> 02:03:25.720
tuning forth for consciousness.

3089
02:03:25.720 --> 02:03:28.257
He says, "my religion is Judaism", right?

3090
02:03:28.257 --> 02:03:31.500
And he said, "and you're the best rabbi I ever met."

3091
02:03:31.500 --> 02:03:32.333
Beautiful.

3092
02:03:32.333 --> 02:03:33.750
So, I said, okay.

3093
02:03:33.750 --> 02:03:35.410
So I never asked him about Zen Buddhism.

3094
02:03:35.410 --> 02:03:39.190
He, you know, like, you don't say to Leonard Cohen,

3095
02:03:39.190 --> 02:03:40.700
where do you get the ideas for your songs?

3096
02:03:40.700 --> 02:03:42.480
And tell me about this Zen Buddhism?

3097
02:03:42.480 --> 02:03:44.773
He came to me to be his rabbi.

3098
02:03:45.910 --> 02:03:48.740
So I got to find out, what are you looking for?

3099
02:03:48.740 --> 02:03:50.150
And can I do it?

3100
02:03:50.150 --> 02:03:52.040
And what he was looking for, I could do.

3101
02:03:52.040 --> 02:03:53.180
And that was our relationship.

3102
02:03:53.180 --> 02:03:54.013
Wow.

3103
02:03:54.013 --> 02:03:55.097
So it was, people say, "what was it like?"

3104
02:03:55.097 --> 02:03:56.560
I say, I was his rabbi,

3105
02:03:56.560 --> 02:03:57.973
I don't know how you want me to explain this.

3106
02:03:57.973 --> 02:04:01.078
It's like, what I do to anybody who choose me the rabbi.

3107
02:04:01.078 --> 02:04:01.911
Right.
What are you after?

3108
02:04:01.911 --> 02:04:02.744
Can I do it?

3109
02:04:02.744 --> 02:04:03.930
All right, let's get to it.

3110
02:04:03.930 --> 02:04:04.860
What a cool experience.

3111
02:04:04.860 --> 02:04:06.563
It really was.
Yeah.

3112
02:04:06.563 --> 02:04:09.470
He was one of the man, just, you know,

3113
02:04:09.470 --> 02:04:10.750
one time I said to him, I said,

3114
02:04:10.750 --> 02:04:11.587
as I started really reading his poetry, I said,

3115
02:04:11.587 --> 02:04:16.423
you know, Leonard, I think most of your poetry is liturgy.

3116
02:04:17.290 --> 02:04:18.980
He says, "I thought all my poetry is liturgy."

3117
02:04:18.980 --> 02:04:22.290
Hmm. He wanted to know which parts weren't.

3118
02:04:22.290 --> 02:04:24.339
Yeah, like wait, like what are you saying?

3119
02:04:24.339 --> 02:04:25.172
You know?

3120
02:04:25.172 --> 02:04:27.310
And so then when I realized that he saw himself

3121
02:04:27.310 --> 02:04:29.223
as being in the line of king David.

3122
02:04:30.550 --> 02:04:31.812
The, you know, the Psalms?

3123
02:04:31.812 --> 02:04:32.645
Yeah.

3124
02:04:32.645 --> 02:04:35.241
And then all these great liturgist through the years,

3125
02:04:35.241 --> 02:04:36.074
people who wrote all this beautiful liturgy

3126
02:04:36.074 --> 02:04:37.140
of the Hebrew tradition?

3127
02:04:37.140 --> 02:04:40.210
He saw himself as in that chain of tradition.

3128
02:04:40.210 --> 02:04:42.190
He says, "I'm a liturgist.

3129
02:04:42.190 --> 02:04:45.470
I write poetry about God and for God,

3130
02:04:45.470 --> 02:04:47.750
and for people who want to sing to God."

3131
02:04:47.750 --> 02:04:48.583
Mm-hmm.

3132
02:04:48.583 --> 02:04:52.413
So, that was what alerted me to what's happening with him.

3133
02:04:56.829 --> 02:04:57.662
And, it was extraordinary.

3134
02:04:57.662 --> 02:05:00.123
It really was...I miss him terribly.

3135
02:05:00.123 --> 02:05:01.350
He was-
Yeah, he was a gift.

3136
02:05:01.350 --> 02:05:04.530
Something that, a kind of person to be around

3137
02:05:04.530 --> 02:05:07.942
and talk to, he was just, utterly unique.

3138
02:05:07.942 --> 02:05:08.775
Yeah.

3139
02:05:08.775 --> 02:05:09.755
Yeah.

3140
02:05:09.755 --> 02:05:10.588
Wow.

3141
02:05:10.588 --> 02:05:11.764
Yeah, he was nice 'cause he really loved my wife,

3142
02:05:11.764 --> 02:05:13.800
they had a very cool relationship.

3143
02:05:13.800 --> 02:05:16.120
Len and I were a little bit awkward with each other,

3144
02:05:16.120 --> 02:05:18.109
she got him, he's a ladies man.

3145
02:05:18.109 --> 02:05:18.942
Uh-huh.

3146
02:05:18.942 --> 02:05:19.970
And my wife got him quickly.

3147
02:05:19.970 --> 02:05:21.640
And he couldn't pull his thing on her.

3148
02:05:21.640 --> 02:05:22.695
Uh-huh.

3149
02:05:22.695 --> 02:05:23.528
(Rich laughing)
So it felt safe with him.

3150
02:05:23.528 --> 02:05:24.930
She says, yeah, Leonard, yeah, whatever.

3151
02:05:24.930 --> 02:05:28.730
You know, like, and so, he felt so safe with my wife.

3152
02:05:28.730 --> 02:05:30.780
They really had a beautiful relationship.

3153
02:05:31.680 --> 02:05:33.830
And then my wife became best friends with Anthony.

3154
02:05:33.830 --> 02:05:34.663
Mm-hmm.

3155
02:05:36.820 --> 02:05:38.284
You might not know this,

3156
02:05:38.284 --> 02:05:39.630
but I'm actually awkward socially, you know,

3157
02:05:39.630 --> 02:05:41.100
so between the three of them,

3158
02:05:41.100 --> 02:05:42.710
they had always loved going out, and I'm kinda like-

3159
02:05:42.710 --> 02:05:43.960
You're on the outside.

3160
02:05:43.960 --> 02:05:45.360
I was kinda like the guy watching this.

3161
02:05:45.360 --> 02:05:46.990
I'm the one who he came to!

3162
02:05:46.990 --> 02:05:48.502
No, no, no, no.

3163
02:05:48.502 --> 02:05:49.335
I don't have any of that.

3164
02:05:49.335 --> 02:05:50.168
I know I'm awkward.

3165
02:05:50.168 --> 02:05:51.740
I know I'm a socially awkward person,

3166
02:05:51.740 --> 02:05:54.590
and sometimes best thing for me is just to sit back

3167
02:05:54.590 --> 02:05:55.811
and watch the magic.

3168
02:05:55.811 --> 02:05:59.380
I'm not reading a lot of social awkwardness today.

3169
02:05:59.380 --> 02:06:01.950
I know. Because I'm on.
Yeah, yeah.

3170
02:06:01.950 --> 02:06:03.250
This is my happy place.

3171
02:06:03.250 --> 02:06:05.560
But, you know like, if we sat socially,

3172
02:06:05.560 --> 02:06:07.320
I'd run out of things to say.

3173
02:06:07.320 --> 02:06:09.290
I have a hard time believing that.

3174
02:06:09.290 --> 02:06:10.123
Okay.

3175
02:06:10.123 --> 02:06:10.956
But we do have to end this.
All right.

3176
02:06:10.956 --> 02:06:11.789
Final thing.

3177
02:06:11.789 --> 02:06:12.622
Right.

3178
02:06:12.622 --> 02:06:15.393
I think it would be good to just end this with a few,

3179
02:06:16.520 --> 02:06:19.450
thoughts for the person who's listening or watching

3180
02:06:19.450 --> 02:06:24.450
who is tiptoeing around the idea of what it means

3181
02:06:24.920 --> 02:06:29.920
to be a spiritual being, having a human experience,

3182
02:06:30.930 --> 02:06:34.890
is trying to, you know, reckon with finding

3183
02:06:34.890 --> 02:06:38.170
a little bit more meaning and purpose in their lives.

3184
02:06:38.170 --> 02:06:43.170
And doesn't have the vernacular or the experience

3185
02:06:44.320 --> 02:06:46.830
to really do this by themselves.

3186
02:06:46.830 --> 02:06:48.190
Like how do you?

3187
02:06:48.190 --> 02:06:49.311
Sure I love the metaphor?

3188
02:06:49.311 --> 02:06:50.144
Yeah.

3189
02:06:50.144 --> 02:06:54.520
It's a very available metaphor.

3190
02:06:54.520 --> 02:06:57.148
Spiritual being, having a human experience,

3191
02:06:57.148 --> 02:06:58.257
is that what you said?

3192
02:06:58.257 --> 02:06:59.090
Mm-hmm.

3193
02:06:59.090 --> 02:07:01.653
But to mean that takes a tremendous amount of work.

3194
02:07:03.060 --> 02:07:05.653
Because you have to go to your spiritual center,

3195
02:07:06.730 --> 02:07:10.800
and that is the most, and only real thing.

3196
02:07:10.800 --> 02:07:14.750
And getting to that spiritual center, you know,

3197
02:07:14.750 --> 02:07:18.250
to the place deep in the inner life,

3198
02:07:18.250 --> 02:07:21.200
where the love of God is flowing in through the fountain

3199
02:07:21.200 --> 02:07:23.570
and you're standing right there in the fountain.

3200
02:07:23.570 --> 02:07:25.520
You're at the deepest part of the soul.

3201
02:07:26.880 --> 02:07:30.170
And you come up out of that, and you have one urge,

3202
02:07:30.170 --> 02:07:31.670
which is to love other people.

3203
02:07:32.720 --> 02:07:34.794
And anything that gets in the way of that,

3204
02:07:34.794 --> 02:07:35.960
you gotta stop it.

3205
02:07:35.960 --> 02:07:38.710
And love life, and create beauty.

3206
02:07:38.710 --> 02:07:42.810
So, so many things come from rooting yourself

3207
02:07:42.810 --> 02:07:45.820
into the deepest part of what I will call,

3208
02:07:45.820 --> 02:07:47.950
the life of spirit, which for me as a religious person

3209
02:07:47.950 --> 02:07:50.570
is the interface between the, you know,

3210
02:07:50.570 --> 02:07:52.220
the mind of God and the mind of human being,

3211
02:07:52.220 --> 02:07:55.970
or the soul of the universe and the soul of the human being.

3212
02:07:55.970 --> 02:08:00.970
Now, when you get there, it's not as if you have meaning,

3213
02:08:02.580 --> 02:08:03.703
meaning has you.

3214
02:08:04.770 --> 02:08:06.630
This is one thing I really believe deeply.

3215
02:08:06.630 --> 02:08:08.530
We like to say, I have meaning in my purpose in life,

3216
02:08:08.530 --> 02:08:10.130
but if you really feel it,

3217
02:08:10.130 --> 02:08:12.190
it arrives at you and grabs you by the lapels,

3218
02:08:12.190 --> 02:08:13.023
and it owns you.
Mm-hmm.

3219
02:08:13.023 --> 02:08:15.690
So I don't have meaning, meaning has me.

3220
02:08:15.690 --> 02:08:19.000
I don't have purpose, purpose has me, it's claimed me.

3221
02:08:19.000 --> 02:08:20.981
You know, going back to the stoic sense.

3222
02:08:20.981 --> 02:08:23.670
So, when you feel claimed by love, justice, truth

3223
02:08:23.670 --> 02:08:27.570
and beauty, that propels you, now that we have claimed you,

3224
02:08:27.570 --> 02:08:29.333
here's what you must do.

3225
02:08:30.250 --> 02:08:32.950
So what happens is that, deepest sense of being claimed

3226
02:08:32.950 --> 02:08:35.260
by the divine, I'm speaking as a religious person,

3227
02:08:35.260 --> 02:08:38.746
when God claims you in the garments of love, justice, truth,

3228
02:08:38.746 --> 02:08:41.870
and beauty, and pushes you into life,

3229
02:08:41.870 --> 02:08:44.210
well, now you know how to be a human.

3230
02:08:44.210 --> 02:08:45.470
And what you have to do is,

3231
02:08:45.470 --> 02:08:48.140
you have to live interfacing in the world,

3232
02:08:48.140 --> 02:08:52.500
propelled by the meaning and purpose that has claimed you.

3233
02:08:52.500 --> 02:08:54.700
For me, in the modalities of love, justice, truth,

3234
02:08:54.700 --> 02:08:59.610
and beauty, but always go back to that deep experience

3235
02:08:59.610 --> 02:09:00.443
of the soul.

3236
02:09:00.443 --> 02:09:03.330
So it's a constant dialectic between, you know,

3237
02:09:03.330 --> 02:09:06.020
being present in the world and being present to the soul,

3238
02:09:06.020 --> 02:09:08.890
present to the world, being present to the soul.

3239
02:09:08.890 --> 02:09:10.467
So, the person who's hearing this and says,

3240
02:09:10.467 --> 02:09:11.530
"how do I do that?"

3241
02:09:11.530 --> 02:09:15.370
You know, I would say, think deep things, you know?

3242
02:09:15.370 --> 02:09:16.560
What is love?

3243
02:09:16.560 --> 02:09:17.393
What is beauty?

3244
02:09:17.393 --> 02:09:18.280
What is truth?

3245
02:09:18.280 --> 02:09:20.450
Just start taking your consciousness

3246
02:09:20.450 --> 02:09:24.630
and drilling through the block between the mind

3247
02:09:24.630 --> 02:09:26.510
and the soul, and drill down.

3248
02:09:26.510 --> 02:09:28.860
I remember it happening to me when I thought,

3249
02:09:28.860 --> 02:09:31.120
well, I have these holy words,

3250
02:09:31.120 --> 02:09:34.570
and knowing that they had soul residents,

3251
02:09:34.570 --> 02:09:36.160
and drilling down through that grated block

3252
02:09:36.160 --> 02:09:39.933
and when I hit the water, and the water just float up,

3253
02:09:40.836 --> 02:09:42.093
that's what I would tell people.

3254
02:09:43.140 --> 02:09:44.750
Yeah, that's beautiful.

3255
02:09:44.750 --> 02:09:49.750
I think there is a epidemic of people feeling a desire for,

3256
02:09:50.650 --> 02:09:53.380
but a lack of that animating force.

3257
02:09:53.380 --> 02:09:57.980
And I think, for those that lack it or are seeking it,

3258
02:09:57.980 --> 02:10:01.010
that was beautifully put, this idea of it claiming you,

3259
02:10:01.010 --> 02:10:04.940
but in order to put yourself in a position to be so claimed,

3260
02:10:04.940 --> 02:10:09.030
you have to commit to living an examined life

3261
02:10:09.030 --> 02:10:13.020
and understand that patience is going to be important

3262
02:10:13.020 --> 02:10:15.063
because it's not a light switch.

3263
02:10:15.910 --> 02:10:17.196
The examined life.

3264
02:10:17.196 --> 02:10:19.100
You have to examine the contents of consciousness

3265
02:10:19.100 --> 02:10:21.880
and go to the deepest place you can, do it every day.

3266
02:10:21.880 --> 02:10:25.150
And that, you'll hit the waters.

3267
02:10:25.150 --> 02:10:26.890
You'll hit the living waters of the soul.

3268
02:10:26.890 --> 02:10:27.723
Mm-hmm.

3269
02:10:27.723 --> 02:10:29.180
Just keep at it.

3270
02:10:29.180 --> 02:10:31.244
That's a good way to end it I think.

3271
02:10:31.244 --> 02:10:32.169
All right.

3272
02:10:32.169 --> 02:10:33.002
I think we landed this plane.

3273
02:10:33.002 --> 02:10:34.079
We landed the plane.

3274
02:10:34.079 --> 02:10:34.912
Yeah, how do you feel?

3275
02:10:34.912 --> 02:10:35.745
I feel great.

3276
02:10:35.745 --> 02:10:36.580
Okay.
That was terrific.

3277
02:10:36.580 --> 02:10:37.413
I loved it.

3278
02:10:37.413 --> 02:10:38.246
Let's do this again.

3279
02:10:38.246 --> 02:10:39.145
Absolutely man.

3280
02:10:39.145 --> 02:10:40.387
Can I come to your synagogue too?

3281
02:10:40.387 --> 02:10:41.220
Anything you want,

3282
02:10:41.220 --> 02:10:42.053
of course.
I'd like to hear you,

3283
02:10:42.053 --> 02:10:43.168
do your thing.

3284
02:10:43.168 --> 02:10:45.740
I would be so honored and this was really,

3285
02:10:45.740 --> 02:10:47.410
we did a significant thing here today.

3286
02:10:47.410 --> 02:10:48.460
You think so?

3287
02:10:48.460 --> 02:10:49.293
Absolutely.

3288
02:10:49.293 --> 02:10:50.170
I hope so. I hope it's helpful to people.

3289
02:10:50.170 --> 02:10:51.003
Yeah.

3290
02:10:51.003 --> 02:10:51.836
I loved it.

3291
02:10:51.836 --> 02:10:52.899
I loved every minute-

3292
02:10:52.899 --> 02:10:54.060
You were right in the zone too.

3293
02:10:54.060 --> 02:10:56.495
So it's really, it's an honor to be interviewed

3294
02:10:56.495 --> 02:10:57.328
by you truly.

3295
02:10:57.328 --> 02:10:58.161
Yeah, thank you.

3296
02:10:58.161 --> 02:10:59.500
If people want to connect with you,

3297
02:10:59.500 --> 02:11:00.333
what's the best place to-

3298
02:11:00.333 --> 02:11:02.970
Well, my synagogue or @torah.org.

3299
02:11:02.970 --> 02:11:04.410
My website, rabbifinley.com.

3300
02:11:04.410 --> 02:11:07.110
It's all very 90s clunky and, you know,

3301
02:11:07.110 --> 02:11:08.560
we're promising to upgrade it,

3302
02:11:08.560 --> 02:11:10.727
and one day have a room like this.

3303
02:11:10.727 --> 02:11:11.560
It's a wonderful studio you have,

3304
02:11:11.560 --> 02:11:13.970
and I got so much to do and so much to say,

3305
02:11:13.970 --> 02:11:15.840
but in the meantime,

3306
02:11:15.840 --> 02:11:20.143
I have my classes on Tuesday and Wednesday nights on Zoom,

3307
02:11:20.143 --> 02:11:22.180
a 45 minutes each-
Right.

3308
02:11:22.180 --> 02:11:25.640
My Shabbat evening, a 20 minute teaching on Friday night

3309
02:11:25.640 --> 02:11:28.700
and our teaching on Saturday morning, open to everybody.

3310
02:11:28.700 --> 02:11:33.070
Many people are not Jewish, because I don't teach Judaism,

3311
02:11:33.070 --> 02:11:36.500
I teach using Jewish symbols, metaphors and myths

3312
02:11:36.500 --> 02:11:37.905
as a way to get at truth.

3313
02:11:37.905 --> 02:11:38.738
Right.

3314
02:11:38.738 --> 02:11:39.571
So everybody's welcome,

3315
02:11:39.571 --> 02:11:41.600
and I think any person like you would love it.

3316
02:11:41.600 --> 02:11:42.433
Excellent.

3317
02:11:42.433 --> 02:11:44.040
I'm gonna check it out and I'll put all those links

3318
02:11:44.040 --> 02:11:44.922
in the show notes.

3319
02:11:44.922 --> 02:11:45.755
Yeah, thank you.

3320
02:11:45.755 --> 02:11:48.220
So everybody can figure it out and hopefully

3321
02:11:48.220 --> 02:11:49.702
send a few new people your way.

3322
02:11:49.702 --> 02:11:50.754
All right, all right.

3323
02:11:50.754 --> 02:11:51.587
Yeah, thanks so much.

3324
02:11:51.587 --> 02:11:52.420
All right, man, it's been a pleasure,

3325
02:11:52.420 --> 02:11:53.543
real pleasure, Thank you.

3326
02:11:53.543 --> 02:11:54.876
Peace, plants.

